  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix bashhub update to not pin version for uv by @rcaloras in https://github.com/rcaloras/bashhub-client/pull/155\r\n* Update GitHub Actions runtimes by @rcaloras in https://github.com/rcaloras/bashhub-client/pull/156\r\n* Replace jsonpickle with dataclasses in the model layer by @rcaloras in https://github.com/rcaloras/bashhub-client/pull/157\r\n* Derive package versions from Git by @rcaloras in https://github.com/rcaloras/bashhub-client/pull/159\r\n* Surface auth failures when saving a command by @rcaloras in https://github.com/rcaloras/bashhub-client/pull/160\r\n* Drop Python 3.9 support and update dependencies by @rcaloras in https://github.com/rcaloras/bashhub-client/pull/161\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/rcaloras/bashhub-client/compare/3.1.0...3.2.0",
